# Versioning

Semver in the root `package.json`. The server reports it on `/healthz` and in
the UI, so bump it with every shipped change, once per chat session.

Keep three places in sync:

- root `package.json` `"version"`
- `README.md` badge on line 3: `![Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/version-X.Y.Z-6d5dfc)`
- `CHANGELOG.md`: new section at the top

| Bump | When |
| --- | --- |
| patch | fix, refactor, docs, tests, CI, dependency update |
| minor | new action, page, check or `dmp-root` command |
| major | breaking change to `config.env`, the sudoers rule, `dmp-root` commands or stored data |

Changelog format: `### vX.Y.Z (YYYY-MM-DD)`, `*` bullets, a bolded area ending
with a colon, present tense, user-visible effect. Areas: `Installer:`,
`Scripts:`, `Panel:`, `Sites:`, `AI:`, `Fix:`, `Docs:`, `Repo:`, `Internal:`.
No em dashes.
